our massive head pieces.

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:46.046 line:92%
♪♪ If you wanna be my lover ♪♪

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:47.447
-This is your range as an actor.
-Yeah.

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:50.116
-Which is one part of you as
an actor as like to Margot,

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:53.086
"I don't want to see you
until we shoot the scene."

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:53.586 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, yeah.

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:55.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then the other part
of you is like,

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:56.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
