00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:57.323 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.225 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, duality. That's Saoirse.
-Yes.

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:01.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
